#: ../../../intro.rst:61
msgid ""
"Xonsh (sounds like \"consh\") is a full-featured and cross-platform Python-"
"based shell. The language is a superset of Python 3 with seamless "
"integration of shell functionality and commands. It works on all major "
"systems including Linux, macOS, Windows, BSD, Jupyter, Android and Raspberry "
"Pi."
msgstr ""
